  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "In the chaotic battle at the damaged third layer of the Gu formation, Fairy Miao Yin faces Qiao Si Liu. Her killing intent rises and a crescent moon shadow appears in her eyes. This is a sight based attack. Because the aura is completely concealed, once it is used one cannot react in time. Qiao Si Liu is hit immediately, then jade green light on her dress and skin forms long willow branches that both defend and fly at Fairy Miao Yin.",
      "chapters": [
        1351
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_formation",
        "char_fairy_miao_yin",
        "char_qiao_si_liu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Feng Jiu Ge teleports with yang pass tune, he is met with Bai Ning Bing’s cold eyes and this move. Fairy Miao Yin’s eyes have two curved moons in them. Like cold eyes, it is a sight based attack and is extremely quick to activate. Feng Jiu Ge is hit and his body shakes. Fairy Miao Yin is shocked: she is confident in its power, but his defensive foundation is extremely deep, and against him the move is nothing much.",
      "chapters": [
        1420
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sight-clash",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "char_bai_ning_bing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ordered to help Bai Ning Bing, she stays at a distance from an immemorial year monkey and stares at its eyes with curved crescent moons in both of hers. After a long time the monkey has no reaction. Immemorial year monkeys live in the River of Time; their eyes are submerged in the river water and have the most dense concentration of time path dao marks, so the sight attack is completely useless.",
      "chapters": [
        1429
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
